{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"17064","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/17064","key":"MC-248684","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"18/Feb/22 5:48 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>Found while testing \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-248682\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-248682\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Translucent blocks moved by pistons aren't affected by fog correctly\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-248682\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n. Very closely relates to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-244190\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-244190\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Entity fog doesn't match the fog of blocks around them\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-244190\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n - it appears to be effectively the same issue in that it was only resolved for entities and was not for pistons.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>Fog starts to occlude moving pistons far earlier than it does normal blocks and entities, especially vertically - it appears to still use the spherical fog rather than the updated cylindrical fog.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Connect pistons to a redstone clock</li>\n\t<li>Travel far enough away from the pistons such that they're close to being obscured by fog, but not quite (low render distance recommended)</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedresults\"></a>Expected results</h3>\n<p>The pistons would still fit in with the other blocks, being occluded by fog at the same rate.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Actualresults\"></a>Actual results</h3>\n<p>When in motion, the pistons appear almost completely fogged, even if the blocks around it are only fogged to a comparatively minor extent.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"19/Feb/22 1:45 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/29906","id":"29906","filename":"2022-02-19_01.42.15.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"muzikbike","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Dublin","accountType":"customer"},"created":"18/Feb/22 5:48 PM","size":"134 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/29906","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/29906"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/29907","id":"29907","filename":"2022-02-19_01.42.32.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avat